name:Veni Sancte Spiritus et emitte;
office-part:Sequentia;
mode:1;
book:Graduale Romanum, 1908, p. 249;
transcriber:Andrew Hinkley;
%%
(c4)O[O most blessed light](k) lux(k) be(ji)a(j)tís(kj)si(i)ma,(h) (;) 
Re[fill the interior of the heart](f)ple(d) cor(c)dis(d) ín(f)ti(g)ma(f) (;) 
Tu(gh)ó(ixi)rum[of thy faithful](h) fi(g)dé(fvED)li(c)um.(d) (::)
6. Si[without](k)ne(k) tu[thy](ji)o(j) nú[divine aid](kj)mi(i)ne,(h) (;) Ni[nothing is](f)hil(d) est(c) in[in man](d) hó(f)mi(g)ne,(f) (;) Ni[nothing is](gh)hil(ixi) est(h) in[harmless](g)nó(fvED)xi(c)um.(d) (::)
7. La[wash](h)va(j) quod[what is](ih) est(i) sór[unclean](ji)di(h)dum,(g) (;) Ri[water](h)ga(h) quod[what is](fe) est(f) á[dry](gf)ri(e)dum,(d) (;) Sa[heal](e)na(g) quod[what is](h) est(g) sáu[hurt](j)ci(i)um.(h) (::)
8. Flec[bend](h)te(j) quod[what is](ih) est(i) rí[rigid](ji)gi(h)dum,(g) (;) Fo[warm](h)ve(h) quod[what is](fe) est(f) frí[cold](gf)gi(e)dum,(d) (;) Re[straighten what is crooked](e)ge(g) quod(h) est(g) dé(j)vi(i)um.(h) (::)
